      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medicine_Lodge%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In October 1867, 15,000 Native Americans met 600 U.S. officials at Medicine Lodge for the largest gathering of its kind in U.S. history.",
